            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes, STS Electronic Recycling offers asset remarketing and liquidation services that assess, test, and remarket viable servers, laptops, and networking hardware, allowing Bakersfield organizations to offset lifecycle upgrade costs while ensuring compliant disposition."
